{# One finding. Shared by the full report and the merge request comment, so it
   is a macro rather than a block inside report.md.j2.
   Trailing double spaces on two lines below are markdown hard breaks — an
   editor stripping them merges the metadata into one paragraph. #}
{% macro finding(f) %}
### {{ SEVERITY_ICON[f.severity] }} {{ f.id }} · {{ f.title }}

**Where:** `{{ f.location }}`  
**Severity:** {{ SEVERITY_LABEL[f.severity] }} · **Category:** {{ f.category }} · **Confidence:** {{ f.confidence | percent }}  
**Checklist items:** {{ f.sources | join(", ") or "—" }}

{{ f.rationale }}
{% if f.suggestion %}

**Fix:** {{ f.suggestion }}
{% endif %}
{% if f.verdict_reason %}

> Judge ({{ f.verdict }}): {{ f.verdict_reason }}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
